      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"source-doc\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8d0c4;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 22px;line-height:1.7;color:#24211e;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.12em;text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px\">E-mail</div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #b9bcc1;padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:14px\"><div><strong>From:</strong> McGuckin, Edward</div><div><strong>To:</strong> All Summer Guests</div><div><strong>Sent:</strong> Wednesday, May 15, 8:02 a.m.</div><div><strong>Subject:</strong> Enjoying local beaches</div></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">We look forward to your visit to the Grand Hotel at Miracle Beach! The town council has recently passed an ordinance requiring that beachgoers pay for <strong style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:#9a5500\">135. -------</strong> to the local beaches. We know how important free beach entry has been for our guests. <strong style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:#9a5500\">136. -------</strong>, we have arranged for beach passes to be available for you—free of charge. All you have to do is ask for the pass when you check in and return the pass when you check out.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Please be advised that municipal beach-patrol staff members will be walking along the beach <strong style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:#9a5500\">137. -------</strong> to check for passes such as the ones we are providing. <strong style=\"white-space:nowrap;color:#9a5500\">138. -------</strong> Make sure to get your pass and avoid the possible penalty.</p></div>",
